    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "8C63E83F1A5A5753",
      "text": "I came instead",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_03",
      "hash64": "23B35AEDDFA19EB5",
      "text": "Aha! I see! Ms. Geeta put you up to this, did she?[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_04",
      "hash64": "23B353EDDFA192D0",
      "text": "It feels like just yesterday that you were out\\ncollectin’ yer badges, and now look at ya—\\r\\nalready Champion Rank![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_05",
      "hash64": "23B354EDDFA19483",
      "text": "You’re like one o’ those fish Pokémon that\\ncompletely changes shape and name as it\\r\\nevolves! All full o’ life. What a great catch![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_06",
      "hash64": "23B355EDDFA19636",
      "text": "And now this! Our promising up-and-comer, here\\nto test my abilities h[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0202)]imerself![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 3,
